* Trimmed SKY130 model library for AnalogDesignGame
* Devices: nfet_01v8 pfet_01v8   Corners: tt ff ss sf fs
* Derived from SkyWater sky130_fd_pr (Apache-2.0), see LICENSE / SOURCE.txt
* Device mismatch is applied by the game itself (Pelgrom dVth per instance),
* using the vth0_slope (AVT) values from the *__mismatch.corner.spice files.

